{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41838","headline":"献徐舍人 · 李中","name":"献徐舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清名喧四海，何止并南金。\n奥学羣英伏，多才万乘钦。\n秩参金殿峻，步历紫微深。\n顾闻承中旨，丝纶演帝心。\n褒雄饶义路，贾马避词林。\n下直无他事，开门对远岑。\n轩窗来晚吹，池沼歇秋霖。\n藓点生棊石，茶烟过竹阴。\n希夷元已达，躁竞岂能侵。\n羽客闲陪饮，诗人伴静吟。\n自渐爲滞物，多幸辱虚襟。\n此日重遭遇，心期出陆沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}